# Technical Documentation

## Project Overview

This project is a responsive personal portfolio website developed for SWE 363 Assignment 1. The website introduces me, presents some of my previous projects, and provides visitors with ways to contact me.

The portfolio was developed using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript and was designed to work across different screen sizes.

## Technologies Used

- HTML5 for the structure and content of the website
- CSS3 for styling and responsive design
- JavaScript for user interaction
- Git and GitHub for version control and repository management
- IntelliJ IDEA as the development environment

